msgid "---"
msgstr ""
"# Release Notes\n"
"\n"
"## v1.0.0\n"
"\n"
"### New Features\n"
"- Added support for the Chinese language interface\n"
"- Introduced a new dashboard for real-time data visualization\n"
"- Implemented user authentication and authorization mechanisms\n"
"- Added export functionality for reports in PDF and Excel formats\n"
"\n"
"### Improvements\n"
"- Enhanced system performance and response times\n"
"- Improved user interface for better usability\n"
"- Optimized database queries for faster data retrieval\n"
"\n"
"### Bug Fixes\n"
"- Fixed an issue where the login page would not load correctly on certain browsers\n"
"- Resolved a bug causing data loss during file uploads\n"
"- Corrected a problem with the date picker not displaying the correct format\n"
"\n"
"### Known Issues\n"
"- Some users may experience slow loading times when accessing the dashboard on mobile devices\n"
"- The export feature may not work correctly with very large datasets\n"
"\n"
"## v0.9.0\n"
"\n"
"### New Features\n"
"- Added a new module for managing user profiles\n"
"- Introduced a search function for quick data lookup\n"
"- Added support for multiple languages\n"
"\n"
"### Improvements\n"
"- Updated the user interface with a more modern design\n"
"- Improved error handling and user feedback messages\n"
"\n"
"### Bug Fixes\n"
"- Fixed an issue where the search function would return incorrect results\n"
"- Resolved a bug causing the application to crash when accessing certain pages\n"
"- Corrected a problem with the notification system not sending alerts\n"
"\n"
"### Known Issues\n"
"- Some users may experience issues with the search function when using special characters\n"
"- The notification system may not work correctly on older versions of browsers\n"
"\n"
"## v0.8.0\n"
"\n"
"### New Features\n"
"- Added a new feature for generating custom reports\n"
"- Introduced a drag-and-drop interface for file uploads\n"
"- Added support for exporting data in CSV format\n"
"\n"
"### Improvements\n"
"- Enhanced the performance of the reporting module\n"
"- Improved the user experience for file uploads\n"
"\n"
"### Bug Fixes\n"
"- Fixed an issue where the report generation would fail for certain data sets\n"
"- Resolved a bug causing the drag-and-drop interface to not work on touch devices\n"
"- Corrected a problem with the CSV export not including all data\n"
"\n"
"### Known Issues\n"
"- The custom report feature may not support all data types\n"
"- The drag-and-drop interface may not work correctly on some older browsers\n"
"\n"
"## v0.7.0\n"
"\n"
"### New Features\n"
"- Added a new dashboard for monitoring system health\n"
"- Introduced a feature for scheduling automated tasks\n"
"- Added support for real-time notifications\n"
"\n"
"### Improvements\n"
"- Improved the system's overall stability and reliability\n"
"- Enhanced the user interface for better navigation\n"
"\n"
"### Bug Fixes\n"
"- Fixed an issue where the system health dashboard would not display accurate data\n"
"- Resolved a bug causing scheduled tasks to not run at the correct time\n"
"- Corrected a problem with real-time notifications not being delivered\n"
"\n"
"### Known Issues\n"
"- The system health dashboard may not be fully accurate on all systems\n"
"- Scheduled tasks may not run correctly if the system is under heavy load\n"
"\n"
"## v0.6.0\n"
"\n"
"### New Features\n"
"- Added a new feature for managing user roles and permissions\n"
"- Introduced a search function for finding users\n"
"- Added support for importing data from external sources\n"
"\n"
"### Improvements\n"
"- Improved the user management interface\n"
"- Enhanced the data import process for better accuracy\n"
"\n"
"### Bug Fixes\n"
"- Fixed an issue where user roles were not being applied correctly\n"
"- Resolved a bug causing the search function to not return all results\n"
"- Corrected a problem with data import failing for certain file formats\n"
"\n"
"### Known Issues\n"
"- The user role management feature may not support all permission types\n"
"- The data import feature may not work correctly with very large files\n"
"\n"
"## v0.5.0\n"
"\n"
"### New Features\n"
"- Added a new module for managing system settings\n"
"- Introduced a feature for customizing the user interface\n"
"- Added support for multiple themes\n"
"\n"
"### Improvements\n"
"- Improved the system's overall performance\n"
"- Enhanced the user interface for better customization\n"
"\n"
"### Bug Fixes\n"
"- Fixed an issue where system settings were not being saved correctly\n"
"- Resolved a bug causing the user interface customization to not apply\n"
"- Corrected a problem with theme selection not working\n"
"\n"
"### Known Issues\n"
"- The system settings module may not support all configuration options\n"
"- The user interface customization may not work correctly on some browsers\n"
"\n"
"## v0.4.0\n"
"\n"
"### New Features\n"
"- Added a new feature for generating invoices\n"
"- Introduced a payment gateway integration\n"
"- Added support for multiple currencies\n"
"\n"
"### Improvements\n"
"- Improved the invoice generation process\n"
"- Enhanced the payment gateway integration for better security\n"
"\n"
"### Bug Fixes\n"
"- Fixed an issue where invoices were not being generated correctly\n"
"- Resolved a bug causing payment gateway integration to fail\n"
"- Corrected a problem with currency conversion\n"
"\n"
"### Known Issues\n"
"- The invoice generation feature may not support all invoice formats\n"
"- The payment gateway integration may not work correctly with all payment methods\n"
"\n"
"## v0.3.0\n"
"\n"
"### New Features\n"
"- Added a new module for managing customer relationships\n"
"- Introduced a feature for tracking customer interactions\n"
"- Added support for customer segmentation\n"
"\n"
"### Improvements\n"
"- Improved the customer relationship management interface\n"
"- Enhanced the customer interaction tracking for better accuracy\n"
"\n"
"### Bug Fixes\n"
"- Fixed an issue where customer data was not being saved correctly\n"
"- Resolved a bug causing customer interaction tracking to fail\n"
"- Corrected a problem with customer segmentation\n"
"\n"
"### Known Issues\n"
"- The customer relationship management module may not support all customer data types\n"
"- The customer interaction tracking may not work correctly with all interaction types\n"
"\n"
"## v0.2.0\n"
"\n"
"### New Features\n"
"- Added a new feature for managing projects\n"
"- Introduced a task management system\n"
"- Added support for project collaboration\n"
"\n"
"### Improvements\n"
"- Improved the project management interface\n"
"- Enhanced the task management system for better efficiency\n"
"\n"
"### Bug Fixes\n"
"- Fixed an issue where project data was not being saved correctly\n"
"- Resolved a bug causing task management to fail\n"
"- Corrected a problem with project collaboration\n"
"\n"
"### Known Issues\n"
"- The project management feature may not support all project types\n"
"- The task management system may not work correctly with very large projects\n"
"\n"
"## v0.1.0\n"
"\n"
"### New Features\n"
"- Initial release of the application\n"
"- Added basic functionality for user management\n"
"- Introduced a simple dashboard for data visualization\n"
"\n"
"### Improvements\n"
"- N/A\n"
"\n"
"### Bug Fixes\n"
"- N/A\n"
"\n"
"### Known Issues\n"
"- The application is in its early stages and may contain bugs\n"
"- Some features may not be fully functional\n"

msgid "版本亮点"
msgstr "Version Highlights"

msgid "Triton-Ascend 3.2.0"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend 3.2.0"

msgid "**首次发布：Ascend NPU 支持**"
msgstr "**First Release: Ascend NPU Support**"

msgid "Triton-Ascend 3.2.0 是第一个正式支持华为 Ascend NPU 的 Triton 版本。此版本基于 Triton 3.2.0 社区版本，专门适配 Ascend NPU 硬件架构。"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend 3.2.0 is the first Triton version to officially support Huawei Ascend NPU. This version is based on the Triton 3.2.0 community release and is specifically adapted for the Ascend NPU hardware architecture."

msgid "主要特性"
msgstr "Key Features"

msgid "**Ascend NPU 全栈支持**"
msgstr "**Ascend NPU Full Stack Support**"

msgid "完整的 Triton IR 到 NPU 指令集编译流水线"
msgstr "Complete Triton IR to NPU instruction set compilation pipeline"

msgid "支持全部 Triton Ops"
msgstr "Support all Triton Ops"

msgid "**性能优化**"
msgstr "**Performance Optimization**"

msgid "NPU 特定内核优化"
msgstr "NPU-specific kernel optimization"

msgid "CV 计算优化"
msgstr "CV computation optimization"

msgid "**开发者工具**"
msgstr "**Developer Tools**"

msgid "支持全面的调试输出"
msgstr "Supports comprehensive debug output"

msgid "编译中间产物转储"
msgstr "Compilation intermediate product dump"

msgid "已知限制"
msgstr "Known Limitations"

msgid "**数据类型**: 部分数据类型支持仍在完善中"
msgstr "**Data Types**: Support for some data types is still being improved."

msgid "**算子覆盖**: 正在持续扩展支持的算子集合"
msgstr "**Operator Coverage**: The set of supported operators is continuously expanding."

msgid "迁移指南"
msgstr "Migration Guide"

msgid "对于现有 Triton GPU 用户迁移到 Ascend NPU，详见 [GPU Triton算子迁移](./migration_guide/migrate_from_gpu.md)"
msgstr "For existing Triton GPU users migrating to Ascend NPU, see [GPU Triton Operator Migration](./migration_guide/migrate_from_gpu.md) for details."

msgid "版本发布策略"
msgstr "Version Release Strategy"

msgid "版本编号"
msgstr "Version Number"

msgid "Triton-Ascend 遵循 [PEP 440](https://peps.python.org/pep-0440/) 版本规范，版本号与上游 Triton 对齐：`vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH[rcN][.postN]`"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend follows the [PEP 440](https://peps.python.org/pep-0440/) version specification, with version numbers aligned with upstream Triton: `vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH[rcN][.postN]`"

msgid "**MAJOR.MINOR**：与上游 Triton 版本一一对应，例如 Triton-Ascend `3.2` 基于 Triton `3.2`"
msgstr "**MAJOR.MINOR**: Corresponds one-to-one with the upstream Triton version. For example, Triton-Ascend `3.2` is based on Triton `3.2`."

msgid "**PATCH**：Triton-Ascend 的 `PATCH` 版本可能高于上游 Triton，用于 `MAJOR.MINOR` 级别的问题修复或改进，例如 Triton-Ascend `3.2.0` 和 `3.2.1` 均基于 Triton `3.2.0`"
msgstr "**PATCH**: The `PATCH` version of Triton-Ascend may be higher than the upstream Triton, used for `MAJOR.MINOR` level bug fixes or improvements. For example, both Triton-Ascend `3.2.0` and `3.2.1` are based on Triton `3.2.0`."

msgid "**rcN**：发布候选版本，根据需要发布以供社区早期测试和反馈"
msgstr "**rcN**: Release candidate version, released as needed for early community testing and feedback."

msgid "**postN**：已发布版本的后续补丁，根据需要发布以修复稳定版本中的问题"
msgstr "**postN**: Subsequent patches for a released version, released as needed to fix issues in the stable version."

msgid "分支策略"
msgstr "Branch Strategy"

msgid "`main` 分支为最新开发分支，跟踪最新上游 Triton 版本"
msgstr "The `main` branch is the latest development branch, tracking the most recent upstream Triton version."

msgid "每个发布版本创建对应的发布开发分支（如 `release/3.2.x`），与社区发布具有相同的 commit id"
msgstr "Each release version creates a corresponding release development branch (e.g., `release/3.2.x`), which has the same commit ID as the community release."

msgid "功能开发应在 fork 仓库中进行，通过 `PR` 合入 Triton-Ascend 仓库"
msgstr "Feature development should be carried out in a forked repository and merged into the Triton-Ascend repository via a `PR`."

